{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28973","headline":"暝投灵智寺渡谿不得却取沿江路往 · 许浑","name":"暝投灵智寺渡谿不得却取沿江路往","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双岩泻一川，回马断桥前。\n古庙阴风地，寒钟暮雨天。\n沙虚留虎迹，水滑带龙涎。\n却下临江路，潮深无渡船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}